THIRD-PARTY SOFTWARE
====================

This distribution contains NO third-party source code. CloudBasher declares
its dependencies in pyproject.toml, pins them in uv.lock and requirements.txt,
and your package manager fetches them from PyPI at install time. Nothing in
this repository is a copy, a vendored tree or a bundled binary of any project
listed below.

The list is reproduced so that anyone evaluating CloudBasher can see what it
will pull in, and under what terms, without installing it first. Each licence
is quoted exactly as that project declares it in its own package metadata.

Dependency set: 48 packages, as pinned in requirements.txt.
This file is generated from that set by the project's release tooling and
checked for drift on every export, so it cannot fall behind the lockfile.


